# Build and Release Folders
bin-debug/
bin-release/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]in/

# Other files and folders
.settings/

# Executables
*.swf
*.air
*.ipa
*.apk

# Project files, i.e. `.project`, `.actionScriptProperties` and `.flexProperties`
# should NOT be excluded as they contain compiler settings and other important
# information for Eclipse / Flash Builder.

***

### 🙈 .gitignore

Le `.gitignore` doit être propre et couvrir tous les fichiers temporaires et les caches de build pour éviter de polluer le dépôt.

```gitignore
# ==============================================================================
# NEXUS OS - Git Exclusion Rules
# ==============================================================================

# --- Build Artifacts ---
# Ignore the entire build directory generated by the script
nexus_os_build/
**/nexus_os_build/

# --- Temporary Mounts & Locks ---
.usb_mnt/
*.lock
*.tmp

# --- Logs & Telemetry ---
*.log
nexus_build.log

# --- Environment & Secrets ---
*.env
usb_devices.env

# --- OS Images & Binaries ---
# Prevent committing large ISO files to the repository
*.iso
*.img
*.bin

# --- System Files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Local Configs ---
# Ignore local overrides of the example configs if renamed
config.nix.local
grub.cfg.local
